AlphaServer 1000 4/200 RM and CAB Systems

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Provides functionality and performance identical to pedestal AlphaServer
   1000 4/200 server

o  Offers expanded storage and I/O, and multiple systems integration
   capabilities in cabinets

o  Conforms to ANSI/EIA standard for 19-inch rackmount systems

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The AlphaServer 1000 4/200 RM (rackmount) server and associated AlphaServer
1000 4/200 CAB (cabinet) systems offer functionality identical to the
AlphaServer 1000 4/200 pedestal systems by utilizing the same CPU, memory,
power supply, and I/O. When integrated in 19-inch industry standard
cabinets, Digital's Alpha based small workgroup servers take on
unprecedented price/performance leadership.

The AlphaServer 1000 4/200 RM offers two PCIslots, seven EISA bus master
slots, and one PCI/EISA interleaved slot. Up to two 5.25-inch half-height
(1.67" high) removable devices, two fixed 3.5-inch (1.67 inches high) SCSI-2
hard drives, and one 3.5-inch slimline (1 inch high) floppy or three
3.5-inch slimline (1 inch high) hard disk drives can be installed.

The AlphaServer 1000 4/200 RM server and associated CAB system provide
easy-maintenance solutions for multiple host configurations -- one of the
best ways to achieve the highest levels of system performance, availability,
and expansion. The AlphaServer 1000 4/200 CAB consists of at least one
AlphaServer 1000 4/200 RM as well as rackmount storage and other associated
equipment mounted in a standard 19-inch Digital cabinet. The AlphaServer
1000 4/200 CAB can support up to 10 StorageWorks shelves in a single 67-inch
cabinet.

BENEFITS

o   Compact Design -- Rackmount systems provide a cost-effective way to
    organize systems, storage, and other options in one easily accessible
    19-inch wide ANSI/EIA standard rackmount cabinet. An AlphaServer 1000
    4/200 CAB system requires only 10.5 inches of vertical rack space as
    compared to 17.5 inches in the pedestal configuration, while providing
    more storage capability.

o   Serviceability -- The rackmount unit is mounted on slides for easy
    access to all necessary components, minimizing down time during service.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The AlphaServer 1000 4/200 RM and associated 1000 4/200 CAB packaged systems
will be available in December through Digital's sales offices and business
partners.

