AlphaServer 2000 4/200

HIGHLIGHTS

o  High performance (up to 400 TPS estimated) server providing symmetric
   multi-processing (SMP) with up to two processors

o  Exceptional reliability and advanced high availability features

o  Leadership three-year hardware warranty

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

As a member of the AlphaServer family of open compatible systems, the
AlphaServer 2000 4/200 offers exceptional reliability, expandability, and
performance. It is an entry multi-processing system that provides scalable,
high performance, 64-bit computing through SMP, with up to two processors.

The reliability features built into the system include thermal management,
automatic restart and reconfiguration, ECC memory, and an optional redundant
power source. The storage subsystem provides a cost effective, space saving,
secure, high data integrity solution. This solution combines controller
based RAID, hot standby, and hot swap of disks -- all within the system
pedestal. By clustering multiple OpenVMS AXP or UNIX systems, even larger
highly available computing environments can be created and expanded easily
and cost effectively.

With its balanced system design, the AlphaServer 2000 4/200 provides large
memory and storage capacity, and high performance industry standard PCI and
EISA I/O to complement its scalable processing power and deliver leadership
total system performance.

All AlphaServer 2000 4/200 capabilities are supported by a three-year
on-site hardware warranty with next business day response -- the best
hardware warranty in the industry.

BENEFITS

In the current competitive and rapidly changing business climate of do more,
faster, for less money, critical applications demand more from the systems
that support them. Users demand quick response times, fast application
processing, and uninterrupted service. IT and system managers demand a
computing environment that satisfies users and can expand incrementally and
cost effectively as the business grows, while preserving current
investments. This environment needs to be purchased and supported for the
least amount of money.

The AlphaServer 2000 4/200 is designed to support these requirements. It
delivers high productivity for business operations, cost-effective solutions
for computing challenges, and safeguards for valuable business information.

