service. IT and system managers demand a computing environment that
satisfies users and can incrementally, cost effectively expand as the
business grows -- while preserving current investments.

The AlphaServer 2100 systems are optimized to support these computing
environments. They deliver high productivity for business operations, cost
effective solutions for computing challenges, and safeguards for valuable
business information.

