The AlphaServer 2100 4/200 is shipping today. The AlphaServer 2100 4/275
will begin shipping in November. Upgrades from the AlphaServer 2100 4/200 to
the 4/275 will be available in the first quarter of the 1995 calendar year.

Part numbers for the existing Digital 2100 server based systems --
