PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The AlphaServer 2100 4/275 RM (Rackmount Server) and the associated
AlphaServer 2100 4/275 CAB (Cabinet) packaged system, formerly the Digital
2100 A500MP-R and A600MP, allow users to create high availability
configurations easily, including OpenVMS Clusters or DECsafe for DEC OSF/1
systems, as well as other configurations that require large amounts of
storage.

The AlphaServer 2100 4/275 CAB system consists of at least one AlphaServer
2100 4/275 RM (as well as rackmount storage and other associated equipment)
mounted in a standard Digital cabinet. The AlphaServer 2100 4/275 RM
supports optional redundant power supplies in an N+1 arrangement, allowing a
single power supply to support a fully loaded system.

Other high availability features available with packaged systems include:
dual AC power controllers, optional rackmounted UPS systems, and redundant
power supplies for the StorageWorks shelves. The AlphaServer 2100 4/275 CAB
system is capable of supporting up to 10 StorageWorks shelves in a single
67-inch cabinet. DSSI storage is available through the use of a EISA to DSSI
adapter.

The new AlphaServer 2100 4/275 CAB and RM share the same characteristics
with the AlphaServer 2100 4/200 and provide significantly increased
performance through the 275 MHz Alpha processor. The AlphaServer 2100 4/200
CAB or RM may be upgraded to the faster processor through a simple, cost
effective processor board swap.

