   fgrep; and egrep. Users can search files or directories of files for a
   regular expression or literal string. The integration between Search and
   editors allows users to perform a search and selectively load a file
   containing a match into an editor.

o  The Man Page Browser displays a reference page in a scrollable hypertext
   window. When using the FUSE editor or emacs, users can select a system
   function in the source code and display the reference page for that
   function in the Man Page Browser, without leaving the editor.

o  The new Debugger provides a Motif interface to two debugger engines --
   DECladebug and dbx -- giving users a choice of preferred debugging
   capabilities (for example, kernel debugging in dbx and C++ debugging in
