o  Any Alpha system running OpenVMS AXP V6.1 or higher, and DEC TCP/IP
   Services for OpenVMS V3.1
o  Any Alpha system running DEC OSF/1 V2.0 or higher
o  Any IBM AS/400 running OS/400 V2.2 and TCP/IP for OS/400 V2.2
o  Any HP 9000 Station Series 700 or 800 running HP-UX V9.0

