DECmigrate V1.1A for OpenVMS AXP Systems

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Maintenance update, available concurrently with the release of OpenVMS
   AXP V6.1

o  Available as an H-kit as well as on the OpenVMS AXP Layered Products
   CD-ROM

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

DECmigrate V1.1A for OpenVMS AXP systems (SPD 39.44.00) continues Digital's
leadership in binary translation technology. Users can utilize DECmigrate
software as a fast and inexpensive way to move their applications from
OpenVMS VAX to OpenVMS AXP systems. For example, users can:

o  Use DECmigrate to translate an application when they've lost the source
   files, when the right AXP compiler isn't available yet, or when they need
   to migrate quickly.

o  Use DECmigrate to uncover dependencies on VAX hardware or to identify
   unaligned or skewed data before they port the source code or translate
   the application.

DECmigrate software translates binary user-mode OpenVMS VAX applications
directly into the OpenVMS AXP equivalents. Unlike other binary translators,
the DECmigrate product works automatically, without human intervention.
Translation provides better performance than emulation. In many cases, a
translated application runs as fast or faster on an AXP system than the
original application runs on a VAX system of equal size.

Runtime support for translated images is included with the OpenVMS AXP
operating system, so a translated image can run on any OpenVMS AXP system --
DECmigrate software is not a prerequisite.

How robust is the translated application? If the input application meets
translation criteria, the translated version is its own duplicate -- the
translated software is as stable as the native version.

BENEFITS

o  Allows users to create OpenVMS AXP versions of existing user-mode OpenVMS
   VAX applications immediately. The translated applications' performance
   usually equals or outperforms the original performance on a VAX system of
   equal size. Only porting the source code can improve the performance even
   more.

o  Allows users to stage their transition to the AXP environment by
   translating their user-mode applications now and porting from source
   later.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

DECmigrate V1.1A for OpenVMS AXP systems is available now with a full,
