A media kit must be purchased with any of the listed DEC SNA Domain Gateway
options. Additional documentation sets may be ordered separately. Both media
and documentation are optionally available on a CD-ROM distribution kit.

Users can upgrade a DECnet/SNA Gateway-CT system to a DEC SNA Domain
Gateway-CT system by purchasing the QP-LBR*A-01 software package. Users can
upgrade a DECnet/SNA Gateway-ST system to a DEC SNA Domain Gateway-ST system
by purchasing the QL-23D*9-BG or QL-23D*9-BR software license.

The On-site Initial Installation Service is suggested for those purchasing
